nd people in equal measure.' \u2014 Source Serif 4, italic, 20px, line-height 1.6, in Antique Linen (#EAE3D2) at 85% opacity. Centered, max-width 600px.\n\n**Body Copy:** The paragraph beginning 'What began as a small grass-court club\u2026' \u2014 Source Serif 4, regular, 17px, line-height 1.75, in Slate Mist (#D6D9E0), centered, max-width 680px. Two lines of generous text that read like an opening statement in a club programme.\n\n**Decorative Crest Mark:** A small symmetrical crest-like ornamental flourish (laurel-adjacent, non-photographic) in Championship Gold sits centered above the eyebrow label, approximately 36px tall, acting as a visual anchor and brand marker.\n\n**No CTAs** in this section \u2014 the header is purely atmospheric and narrative.\n\n**Spacing:** 80px top padding, 40px between text block bottom and the timeline illustration strip, 0px bottom padding (the illustration bleeds into the section bottom edge). On mobile, reduce top padding to 48px, headline to 34px, and the illustration is hidden or reduced to a subtle texture strip."
