x from the container edge). All cards are full-width, left-aligned, connected to the spine by a short horizontal rule. Node medallions remain. Vertical spacing between entries: 32px.\n\n**Spacing Between Entries (Desktop):** 48px vertical gap between consecutive entry pairs.\n\n**Bottom of Section:** A thin ornamental Championship Gold rule (full container width, 1px) with a small centered crest flourish marks the section close before transitioning to the coaching grid."
