ment: a Burgundy Crest (#7D1D3F) ribbon/banner across the top-right corner of the card with the highlight text in Montserrat uppercase, 9px, Crown Ivory \u2014 like a classic 'featured' badge.\n- Badge Icon: Centered at the top of the card content, 64px, as described above.\n- Tier Name: Playfair Display, ~22px, Courtside Navy, bold, centered, below the icon.\n- Price: Montserrat, uppercase, 28px, Championship Gold, bold, centered \u2014 the dominant visual element after the tier name. Sub-label '/ year' in Montserrat 12px, Ink Smoke.\n- Description: Source Serif 4, 14px, line-height 1.7, Ink Smoke, left-aligned, 16px top margin.\n- Divider: A 1px Slate Mist (#D6D9E0) horizontal rule separating the price block from the description.\nOn hover: card lifts with deeper shadow (0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18)), Championship Gold border intensifies to 2px.\n\n**CTA:**\n'Apply for Membership' \u2014 centered below the card grid, 40px margin-top. Rendered as a solid Championship Gold (#B8962E) button with Courtside Navy text, Montserrat uppercase, 13px, 0.14em spacing, 48px height, 28px horizontal padding, 4px border-radius. On hover: background lightens slightly, Courtside Navy border appears.\n\n**Bottom Ornament:** A thin 1px Championship Gold ornamental rule with a small centered crest flourish marks the section close."
