urtside Navy, bold, centered, 12px below the icon.\n- Description: Source Serif 4, 14px, line-height 1.7, Ink Smoke, left-aligned (or centered for short descriptions), 10px top margin.\n- A thin 1px Championship Gold decorative rule (32px wide, centered) sits between the icon and the title as a micro-ornamental detail, consistent with the page-wide motif.\n\n**No CTAs** in this section \u2014 the facilities grid serves as a reassuring close, letting the content speak without a conversion push (the membership CTA above has already handled conversion).\n\n**Section Close:** The section ends with a generous 96px bottom padding flowing directly into the global footer (Courtside Navy background). A subtle gradient fade from Antique Linen to Courtside Navy over 48px at the very bottom of the section eases the visual transition into the footer without an abrupt cut."
