          "nl_prompt": "Design a season statistics summary section that sits directly below the page header on a Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8) background. The section opens with the eyebrow label 'Season at a Glance' in Montserrat small caps, Championship Gold (#B8962E), 12px, wide letter-spacing, centred. Below it, the headline 'The Scoreboard So Far' in Playfair Display, Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A), 34px, centred, followed immediately by a Championship Gold ornamental rule (1px, 60px, diamond centre glyph).\n\nBelow the headline block, render the four stat items in a horizontal 4-column grid on desktop (collapsing to a 2\u00d72 grid on tablet and a single stacked column on mobile). Each stat tile is a card with a Crown Ivory surface, 1px Slate Mist (#D6D9E0) border, 24px padding, and a subtle Championship Gold top border accent (3px solid, full card width) to reinforce the scoreboard aesthetic.\n\nWithin each stat card: the stat figure ('24', '17W \u00b7 5D \u00b7 2L', '3', '6') is set in Playfair Display, Courtside Navy, 40\u201344px, bold weight, centred. The description below it ('Fixtures played across all squads this season.' etc.) is set in Source Serif 4, Ink Smoke (#4A4E5A), 14px, centred, line-height 1.6, max 2 lines.\n\nBelow the 4-column stat grid, place the horizontal bar chart asset. The chart is rendered in a vintage sporting ledger style \u2014 cream/ivory background panel, Courtside Navy axis labels in Montserrat small caps, bars filled in Burgundy Crest (wins), Championship Gold (draws), and Ink Smoke (losses) for each squad row (Men's 1st, Women's 1st, Mixed, Junior A). The chart is contained in a full-width card panel with 1px Slate Mist border, 24px internal padding, and a Montserrat small caps chart title 'Squad Performance \u2014 2024\u201325 Season' in Courtside Navy at the top left. Chart width: 100% of content column (max 960px), height approximately 220px on desktop.\n\nSection vertical padding: 72px top and bottom on desktop, 48px on mobile. The section sits on Crown Ivory and transitions to an Antique Linen panel below."
        },
        {
          "id": "fixtures-section-3",
          "nl_prompt": "Design the Upcoming Fixtures section on an Antique Linen (#EAE3D2) background panel to visually separate it from the stats section above. Open with the eyebrow label 'Upcoming Fixtures' in Montserrat small caps, Burgundy Crest (#7D1D3F), 12px, wide letter-spacing, left-aligned within the content column (max-width 1200px, centred on page). Below the eyebrow, the headline 'Next on Court' in Playfair Display, Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A), 34px, left-aligned. Below the headline, the subheadline 'All fixtures subject to weather and court availability. Check the news page for late changes.' in Source Serif 4, Ink Smoke (#4A4E5A), 15px, italic, left-aligned. A Championship Gold ornamental rule (1px, 48px, diamond glyph) follows, also left-aligned.\n\nBelow the header block, render the 6 fixture items as a 2-column card grid on desktop (1-column on mobile). Each fixture card has a Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8) surface, 1px Slate Mist (#D6D9E0) border, 28px internal padding, and a 3px Burgundy Crest left border accent. On hover, the card background shifts to a slightly deeper Antique Linen with a subtle box shadow.\n\nCard anatomy (top to bottom): \n1. A row of metadata pill badges \u2014 Squad name (e.g. 'Men's 1st'), Type (e.g. 'League'), and Venue \u2014 each a small rounded pill in Montserrat uppercase, 11px. Squad badge: Courtside Navy background, Crown Ivory text. Type badge: Championship Gold background, Courtside Navy text. Venue badge: Forest Court (#2D5016) for Home, Burgundy Crest for Away, both with Crown Ivory text.\n2. The fixture title (e.g. 'Men's 1st XV \u2014 County League Div. 1') in Playfair Display, Courtside Navy, 18px, sentence case, top-margin 10px.\n3. The description (date, time, opponent, venue detail) in Source Serif 4, Ink Smoke, 14px, line-height 1.6, top-margin 6px.\n\nGrid gutter: 24px. Section vertical padding: 72px top and bottom on desktop, 48px on mobile. A fine Championship Gold rule closes the section at the bottom."
        },
        {
          "id": "fixtures-section-4",
          "nl_prompt": "Design the Recent Results section on a Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8) background, returning to the lighter base tone to alternate with the Antique Linen panel above. Open with the eyebrow label 'Recent Results' in Montserrat small caps, Burgundy Crest (#7D1D3F), 12px, wide letter-spacing, left-aligned. Below, the headline 'How We Have Played' in Playfair Display, Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A), 34px, left-aligned. A Championship Gold ornamental rule (1px, 48px, diamond glyph) follows, left-aligned.\n\nRender the 4 result items as a 2-column card grid on desktop (1-column on mobile), with 24px gutters. Each result card has a Crown Ivory surface, 1px Slate Mist (#D6D9E0) border, 28px internal padding, and a result-coded 3px left border: Forest Court (#2D5016) for Win, Championship Gold (#B8962E) for Draw, and Burgundy Crest (#7D1D3F) for Loss.\n\nCard anatomy (top to bottom):\n1. A result badge row: a prominent result pill (Montserrat uppercase, 11px, bold) \u2014 'WIN' on Forest Court background, 'DRAW' on Championship Gold background, 'LOSS' on Burgundy Crest background, all with Crown Ivory text \u2014 followed by the score in Playfair Display, Courtside Navy, 16px bold (e.g. '5\u20131'), and the date in Montserrat small caps, Ink Smoke, 11px, right-aligned on the same row.\n2. The result title (e.g. 'Men's 1st \u2014 Won 5\u20131 vs. Thornbury LTC') in Playfair Display, Courtside Navy, 18px, top-margin 10px.\n3. The description (match narrative) in Source Serif 4, Ink Smoke, 14px, line-height 1.6, top-margin 6px.\n\nOn hover, cards shift to an Antique Linen background with a subtle shadow lift. No CTAs in this section. Section vertical padding: 72px top and bottom on desktop, 48px on mobile. A fine Championship Gold ornamental rule closes the section at the bottom, transitioning to the CTA banner."
        },
        {
          "id": "fixtures-section-5",
          "nl_prompt": "Design a full-width CTA banner section that closes the Fixtures page, mirroring the dark tone of the page header to bookend the page with authority. The section uses a Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A) background with a subtle texture suggestion (a very faint repeating diamond lattice pattern in a slightly lighter navy, approximately 4% opacity) to add depth without distracting from the content.\n\nAll content is symmetrically centred on a vertical axis. At the top, the eyebrow label 'Want to Compete?' in Montserrat small caps, Championship Gold (#B8962E), 12px, wide letter-spacing, centred. Below it, a Championship Gold ornamental rule (1px, 60px, diamond centre glyph).\n\nThe headline 'Earn Your Place on the Team Sheet' in Playfair Display, Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8), 40\u201344px on desktop (32px on mobile), sentence case, centred, with generous top and bottom margins. Below the headline, the subheadline 'Our squads are always looking for committed players. Get in touch to discuss squad trials and competitive membership.' in Source Serif 4, Slate Mist (#D6D9E0), 17px, centred, max-width 560px, line-height 1.65.\n\nBelow the subheadline, render two CTA buttons side by side (stacked on mobile) with 16px gap between them:\n1. 'Contact the Club' \u2014 primary button: Burgundy Crest (#7D1D3F) background, Crown Ivory text, Montserrat uppercase, 13px, wide letter-spacing, 14px vertical padding, 32px horizontal padding, no border radius (squared corners to match heritage aesthetic), subtle gold border (1px Championship Gold) on hover.\n2. 'Learn About Membership' \u2014 secondary button: transparent background, 1px Crown Ivory border, Crown Ivory text, same Montserrat treatment. On hover, background fills with a very low-opacity Crown Ivory (10%) and border becomes Championship Gold.\n\nA final Championship Gold ornamental rule appears beneath the buttons before the footer. Section vertical padding: 96px top and bottom on desktop, 64px on mobile."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "slug": "news",
      "page_level_design_instruction": "The News page for Courtside & Crown functions as an editorial club magazine \u2014 \"The Courtside Chronicle\" \u2014 and must feel like a curated, authoritative publication rooted in heritage aesthetics. The overall page background is Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8), providing a warm parchment-like canvas throughout. Alternate sections use Antique Linen (#EAE3D2) to create rhythmic depth and visual breathing room between editorial zones, preventing monotony across a content-dense page.\n\nSection rhythm follows a deliberate editorial cadence: a grand masthead-style page header \u2192 a prominent article listing grid \u2192 a full-width featured story editorial block \u2192 a symmetrical category browse grid \u2192 a contained CTA closer. This five-beat rhythm mirrors the pacing of a quality print magazine, moving from announcement to depth to navigation to action.\n\nTypography is strictly hierarchical: all section headlines use Playfair Display in large, high-contrast weights with tight letter-spacing at display sizes, evoking a broadsheet editorial authority. Eyebrow labels throughout use Montserrat in uppercase small caps with wide letter-spacing (0.15\u20130.2em) in Championship Gold (#B8962E) or Burgundy Crest (#7D1D3F), functioning as section identifiers. Body copy and article descriptions use Source Serif 4 at comfortable reading sizes with approximately 1.7 line height.\n\nThe card grid layout family is expressed through the article listing section (vertical editorial cards with metadata) and the category browse section (a 3\u00d72 tile grid). Cards use Crown Ivory surfaces with Slate Mist (#D6D9E0) borders, a subtle drop shadow, and Antique Linen hover states. Category tags and date metadata use Montserrat small caps in Ink Smoke (#4A4E5A).\n\nOrnamental dividers \u2014 thin horizontal rules in Championship Gold \u2014 separate eyebrow labels from headlines in every section, reinforcing the heritage-classic visual language. Symmetrical compositions are used wherever possible: the page header is centred, the featured story block is centred, and the CTA footer is centred.\n\nColour accents are restrained and purposeful: Burgundy Crest is reserved for primary CTAs, active category highlights, and ornamental flourishes. Championship Gold appears on decorative rule lines, badge-style article count indicators, and crest marks. Forest Court (#2D5016) is used sparingly for category tags such as \"Player Achievement\" and \"Junior Academy\" to signal positive, growth-oriented content.\n\nResponsive behaviour: on desktop, the article list renders as a 2-column editorial card grid (with a featured lead card spanning full width at top); on tablet it collapses to a single column with full-width cards; on mobile all sections stack vertically with increased vertical padding. The category grid is 3\u00d72 on desktop, 2\u00d73 on tablet, and 1\u00d76 on mobile. Navigation and footer are inherited from the shared design system in Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A).\n\nThe page must feel like a distinguished club publication \u2014 not a generic blog. Every typographic and spatial decision should reinforce the sense that this content has been curated with care, pride, and institutional authority.",
      "section_design_plans": [
        {
          "id": "news-section-1",
          "nl_prompt": "Design a grand editorial page header for the Courtside & Crown News section, styled as the masthead of a heritage sporting gazette. The section sits on a Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A) background to create maximum contrast with the Crown Ivory body of the page below \u2014 this dark masthead treatment signals an authoritative editorial identity, like the front page of a broadsheet.\n\nAt the very top centre of the section, place the illustrated vintage newspaper masthead asset: a banner reading 'The Courtside Chronicle' decorated with a small tennis racket and laurel ornament in the style of a 1930s sporting gazette. This illustration should be rendered at approximately 520px wide, horizontally centred, and treated as a display-grade identity mark \u2014 not a decorative afterthought. It should appear in Championship Gold (#B8962E) tones against the navy background, evoking engraved print.\n\nDirectly beneath the illustration, place the eyebrow label 'The Courtside Chronicle' in Montserrat uppercase small caps, Championship Gold, wide letter-spacing (0.18em), at a small size (13\u201314px). Below that, a thin ornamental rule line in Championship Gold spans approximately 200px centred.\n\nThe headline 'News, Stories & Dispatches from the Club' is set in Playfair Display at a large display size (52\u201358px on desktop), Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8), sentence case, with tight letter-spacing (-0.01em). It should feel like a broadsheet front-page headline \u2014 weighty and composed.\n\nThe subheadline 'The latest from our courts, our coaches, and our community \u2014 told with the care this club deserves.' follows in Source Serif 4, italic, Crown Ivory at 60% opacity, approximately 20px, centred, with a comfortable max-width of 580px to maintain elegant line lengths.\n\nThe section has generous vertical padding (120px top, 100px bottom) and uses a subtle full-bleed texture overlay \u2014 a very faint diagonal linen grain at 4% opacity \u2014 to add tactile depth without competing with the typography. The composition is fully centred and symmetrical. No CTAs in this section."
        },
        {
          "id": "news-section-2",
          "nl_prompt": "Design an editorial article listing section titled 'Fresh from the Courts' that presents the five most recent news stories as a structured card grid. The section background is Crown Ivory (#F5F0E8). Open with the eyebrow 'Latest Stories' in Montserrat uppercase small caps, Burgundy Crest (#7D1D3F), wide letter-spacing (0.16em), centred, followed by a thin Championship Gold ornamental rule (160px wide, centred), then the headline 'Fresh from the Courts' in Playfair Display, Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A), approximately 40px, centred, sentence case.\n\nThe five articles are displayed as editorial cards in a structured grid. The first article \u2014 'Centenary Scholarship Fund Now Open for Applications' \u2014 is a featured lead card spanning the full content width (approximately 900px max-width, centred). It is taller and more prominent, with a Antique Linen (#EAE3D2) background, a left-side Burgundy Crest accent bar (6px wide, full card height), and generous internal padding (40px). The category tag 'Club Announcement' appears in Montserrat small caps, Forest Court (#2D5016), at the top left. The date '10 September 2024' appears in Montserrat small caps, Ink Smoke (#4A4E5A), beside the category tag separated by a Slate Mist dot divider. The article title is set in Playfair Display, Courtside Navy, approximately 26px. The description follows in Source Serif 4, Ink Smoke, 17px, with 1.7 line height. A subtle 'Read More \u2192' link in Burgundy Crest, Montserrat small caps, appears at the bottom right of the card.\n\nThe remaining four articles \u2014 James Rutherford, New Ball Machine Studio, Season Review, and Club Open Tournament \u2014 are arranged in a 2\u00d72 card grid below the lead card, with 24px gutters. Each card has a Crown Ivory surface, Slate Mist (#D6D9E0) 1px border, 4px border-radius, and a soft drop shadow (0 2px 12px rgba(27,42,74,0.08)). Internal padding is 28px. Category tags use Montserrat small caps in contextually appropriate accent colours: 'Player Achievement' in Forest Court, 'Facilities' in Championship Gold, 'Match Report' in Courtside Navy, 'Events' in Burgundy Crest. Dates appear in Ink Smoke Montserrat small caps. Titles in Playfair Display Courtside Navy ~20px. Descriptions in Source Serif 4 Ink Smoke 16px. Hover state lifts the card with a slightly deeper shadow and transitions the background to Antique Linen.\n\nOn tablet, the 2\u00d72 grid collapses to a single column. On mobile, all cards stack vertically. Section vertical padding: 96px top and bottom."
        },
        {
          "id": "news-section-3",
          "nl_prompt": "Design a full-width featured editorial story block for the centenary feature 'One Hundred Years of Courtside & Crown: A Century Remembered'. This section uses an Antique Linen (#EAE3D2) background to differentiate it from the surrounding Crown Ivory sections, giving it the weight of a magazine centrepiece spread.\n\nThe decorative border pattern asset \u2014 a Victorian sporting frieze of alternating tennis balls, rackets, and laurel sprigs \u2014 is placed as a full-width horizontal band at the very top edge of the section and mirrored as an identical band at the very bottom edge. Each frieze band is approximately 40\u201348px tall, rendered in Championship Gold (#B8962E) line-art style against the Antique Linen background, functioning as ornamental framing that gives the block the feel of a heritage magazine spread.\n\nWithin the framed area, the layout is centred with a content max-width of 720px. At the top, the eyebrow label 'Featured Story' appears in Montserrat uppercase small caps, Burgundy Crest (#7D1D3F), wide letter-spacing (0.18em). Below it, a thin Championship Gold ornamental rule (120px, centred). The headline 'One Hundred Years of Courtside & Crown: A Century Remembered' is set in Playfair Display, Courtside Navy (#1B2A4A), approximately 44\u201348px on desktop, sentence case, centred, with tight letter-spacing. Allow the headline to wrap naturally across 2\u20133 lines for editorial drama.\n\nThe subheadline 'From four grass courts on a country estate to a thriving academy of three thousand members \u2014 the story of how a club became a community.' appears in Source Serif 4, italic, Ink Smoke (#4A4E5A), approximately 19px, centred, with 1.7 line height, max-width 620px.\n\nA second thin Championship Gold rule (80px, centred) separates the subheadline from the body copy. The body paragraph is set in Source Serif 4, Courtside Navy, 18px, 1.75 line height, left-aligned within the centred content column, giving it an editorial essay quality.\n\nThe CTA 'Read the Full History' is a prominent rectangular button in Burgundy Crest background, Crown Ivory text, Montserrat uppercase small caps, 14px, wide letter-spacing, with 16px vertical and 36px horizontal padding, centred below the body copy with 40px top margin. Hover state darkens to a deeper burgundy. Section vertical padding: 96px top and bottom (inside the friezes), with an additional 16px of padding between the frieze bands and the inner content."
        },

input.content:
/* ==========================================================================
   Courtside & Crown — Heritage Tennis Academy
   Global Design System
   ========================================================================== */

@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400;1,600&family=Source+Serif+4:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

:root {
  --ivory: #F5F0E8;
  --navy: #1B2A4A;
  --burgundy: #7D1D3F;
  --gold: #B8962E;
  --gold-bright: #d4ae3a;
  --forest: #2D5016;
  --linen: #EAE3D2;
  --slate: #D6D9E0;
  --ink: #4A4E5A;
  --shadow-card: 0 2px 12px rgba(27, 42, 74, 0.08);
  --shadow-lift: 0 8px 24px rgba(27, 42, 74, 0.14);
  --max-w: 1200px;
  --pad-x: clamp(20px, 5vw, 80px);
  --section-pad: clamp(56px, 9vw, 96px);
  --font-heading: 'Playfair Display', 'Times New Roman', serif;
  --font-body: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;
  --font-accent: 'Montserrat', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--navy);
  background: var(--ivory);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}

img, svg { max-width: 100%; display: block; }

a { color: var(--burgundy); text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

p { margin: 0 0 1em; }

h1, h2, h3, h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 0.4em;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

/* ============ Navigation ============ */
.site-nav {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 60;
  background: var(--navy);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184, 150, 46, 0.3);
}
.nav-inner {
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 18px var(--pad-x);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 24px;
}
.brand-mark {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  color: var(--ivory);
  text-decoration: none;
}
.brand-mark:hover { text-decoration: none; }
.brand-mark svg { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
.brand-name {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  color: var(--ivory);
  line-height: 1;
}
.brand-name em {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.32em;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-style: normal;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin-top: 4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.nav-links {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  gap: 4px;
}
.nav-links a {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ivory);
  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
  transition: border-color .2s, color .2s;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold-bright); text-decoration: none; }
.nav-links a.is-active {
  color: var(--gold);
  border-bottom-color: var(--gold);
}
.nav-toggle {
  display: none;
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  color: var(--ivory);
  padding: 8px 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  cursor: pointer;
}

/* ============ Layout helpers ============ */
.section { padding: var(--section-pad) var(--pad-x); position: relative; }
.section-inner { max-width: var(--max-w); margin: 0 auto; }
.section--ivory { background: var(--ivory); }
.section--linen { background: var(--linen); }
.section--navy {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--ivory);
}
.section--navy h1, .section--navy h2, .section--navy h3 { color: var(--ivory); }

.section-head { text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 48px; }
.section-head--left { text-align: left; margin-left: 0; max-width: var(--max-w); }
.eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.eyebrow--burgundy { color: var(--burgundy); }
.section--navy .eyebrow { color: var(--gold); }

.headline {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}
.section--navy .headline { color: var(--ivory); }

.subheadline {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 19px);
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.65;
  font-style: italic;
  margin: 0 auto;
  max-width: 600px;
}
.section--navy .subheadline { color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.85); }

/* Ornamental divider — gold rule with diamond */
.ornament {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin: 18px auto 22px;
  gap: 10px;
  color: var(--gold);
}
.ornament--left { justify-content: flex-start; margin-left: 0; }
.ornament .rule {
  width: 56px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--gold);
  display: block;
}
.ornament .lozenge {
  width: 7px;
  height: 7px;
  background: var(--gold);
  transform: rotate(45deg);
}

/* ============ Buttons ============ */
.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 14px 36px;
  border: 2px solid transparent;
  cursor: pointer;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background .2s, color .2s, border-color .2s;
}
.btn:hover { text-decoration: none; }
.btn--primary {
  background: var(--burgundy);
  color: var(--ivory);
  border-color: var(--burgundy);
}
.btn--primary:hover {
  background: #67152f;
  border-color: var(--gold);
}
.btn--ghost-light {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ivory);
  border-color: var(--ivory);
}
.btn--ghost-light:hover {
  background: var(--ivory);
  color: var(--navy);
}
.btn--ghost-dark {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--navy);
  border-color: var(--navy);
}
.btn--ghost-dark:hover {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--ivory);
}
.btn--gold {
  background: var(--gold);
  color: var(--navy);
  border-color: var(--gold);
}
.btn--gold:hover {
  background: var(--gold-bright);
  border-color: var(--navy);
}
.cta-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-top: 24px;
}
.cta-row--left { justify-content: flex-start; }

/* ============ Hero ============ */
.hero {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--ivory);
  padding: clamp(60px, 8vw, 100px) var(--pad-x) clamp(80px, 10vw, 120px);
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hero::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 100%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.hero-inner {
  max-width: 860px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.hero-emblem {
  width: 150px;
  height: 150px;
  margin: 0 auto 24px;
}
.hero-eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.32em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin: 0;
}
.hero-headline {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 78px);
  line-height: 1.1;
  color: var(--ivory);
  margin: 24px 0 24px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.hero-sub {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 20px);
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--slate);
  max-width: 620px;
  margin: 0 auto 32px;
}
.hero-scroll {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 32px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  color: var(--gold);
  animation: bob 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  z-index: 1;
}
@keyframes bob {
  0%, 100% { transform: translate(-50%, 0); opacity: 0.7; }
  50% { transform: translate(-50%, 8px); opacity: 1; }
}

/* ============ Page Header (non-hero) ============ */
.page-header {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--ivory);
  padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 104px) var(--pad-x);
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.page-header-inner {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.page-header h1 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px);
  color: var(--ivory);
  margin: 8px 0 16px;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}
.page-header .subheadline {
  color: rgba(234, 227, 210, 0.9);
  max-width: 620px;
  margin: 0 auto 16px;
}
.page-header .body-copy {
  color: var(--slate);
  font-style: normal;
  font-size: 16px;
  max-width: 680px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.page-header .small-crest {
  margin: 0 auto 12px;
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  color: var(--gold);
}
.page-header__band {
  margin-top: 48px;
  width: 100%;
  height: 80px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 100%);
  position: relative;
}

/* ============ Stats ============ */
.stats-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 28px;
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.stat-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 32px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(27,42,74,0.07);
  position: relative;
}
.stat-card .stat-figure {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 56px);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  line-height: 1;
}
.stat-card .stat-rule {
  width: 40px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--gold);
  margin: 14px auto;
}
.stat-card .stat-desc {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.55;
  margin: 0;
}

/* ============ Feature grid (3-up) ============ */
.feature-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 28px;
  max-width: 1120px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.feature-card {
  background: var(--linen);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 40px 32px;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  transition: background .25s, border-color .25s, box-shadow .25s;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
}
.feature-card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; right: 0; top: 0;
  height: 3px;
  background: transparent;
  transition: background .25s;
}
.feature-card:hover {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border-color: var(--gold);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lift);
}
.feature-card:hover::before { background: var(--gold); }
.feature-card .icon-badge {
  width: 56px;
  height: 56px;
  background: var(--navy);
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--gold);
}
.feature-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}
.feature-card .micro-rule {
  width: 32px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--gold);
  margin: 0 auto 16px;
}
.feature-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0;
}

/* Six-up feature grid (facilities) */
.feature-grid--six {
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
}
.facility-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 28px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  transition: box-shadow .25s, border-top-color .25s;
  position: relative;
}
.facility-card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; right: 0; top: -1px;
  height: 3px;
  background: transparent;
  transition: background .25s;
}
.facility-card:hover {
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(27,42,74,0.10);
}
.facility-card:hover::before { background: var(--gold); }
.facility-card .facility-icon {
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  margin: 0 auto 10px;
  color: var(--navy);
}
.facility-card .micro-rule { width: 32px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold); margin: 0 auto 12px; }
.facility-card h3 { font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
.facility-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }

/* ============ Testimonial cards ============ */
.testimonial-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 28px;
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.testimonial-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 40px 32px 32px;
  position: relative;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
}
.testimonial-card .quote-mark {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 80px;
  line-height: 0.8;
  color: var(--gold);
  display: block;
  margin: -12px 0 -8px;
}
.testimonial-card blockquote {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 17px;
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--navy);
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin: 0 0 20px;
  padding: 0;
}
.testimonial-card .divider {
  width: 40px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--slate);
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.testimonial-card cite {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-style: normal;
}

/* ============ CTA section close ============ */
.cta-band {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--ivory);
  padding: clamp(56px, 9vw, 104px) var(--pad-x);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-align: center;
}
.cta-band__pattern {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  opacity: 0.08;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.cta-band__inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.cta-band h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(30px, 4.5vw, 52px);
  color: var(--ivory);
  margin: 12px 0 20px;
  line-height: 1.15;
}
.cta-band .subheadline {
  color: var(--slate);
  font-style: normal;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 19px);
}

/* ============ Timeline (Club page) ============ */
.timeline {
  position: relative;
  max-width: 980px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 16px 0;
}
.timeline::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 2px;
  background: var(--gold);
  transform: translateX(-50%);
}
.timeline-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 60px 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.timeline-row .node {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--navy);
  border: 2px solid var(--gold);
  margin: 0 auto;
  z-index: 1;
}
.timeline-row .connector {
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--gold);
}
.timeline-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 22px 22px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(27,42,74,0.08);
  max-width: 360px;
}
.timeline-card h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 18px;
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  color: var(--navy);
}
.timeline-card h4 .year { color: var(--gold); margin-right: 6px; }
.timeline-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0;
}
.timeline-row.left .timeline-card { justify-self: end; margin-right: 12px; }
.timeline-row.right .timeline-card { justify-self: start; margin-left: 12px; }
.timeline-row.left .filler { display: block; }
.timeline-row.right .filler { display: block; }

/* ============ Coach grid ============ */
.coach-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  max-width: 1140px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.coach-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 28px 22px;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  transition: background .25s, border-left-color .25s, box-shadow .25s;
}
.coach-card:hover {
  background: var(--linen);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--burgundy);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(27,42,74,0.10);
}
.coach-card .avatar {
  width: 72px;
  height: 72px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--linen);
  border: 2px solid var(--gold);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin: 0 auto 16px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 26px;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-weight: 600;
}
.coach-card .role {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0 0 4px;
}
.coach-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 18px;
  margin: 0 0 10px;
  color: var(--navy);
}
.coach-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  text-align: left;
}
.coach-card .credential {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--forest);
  color: var(--ivory);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 5px 10px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.coach-card .speciality {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold);
  display: block;
}

/* ============ Membership tiers (pricing) ============ */
.pricing-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  max-width: 1140px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.pricing-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 32px 26px;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  transition: box-shadow .25s, border-width .25s;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.pricing-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18); }
.pricing-card .ribbon {
  position: absolute;
  top: 12px;
  right: -38px;
  background: var(--burgundy);
  color: var(--ivory);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 5px 40px;
  transform: rotate(45deg);
}
.pricing-card .badge-icon {
  width: 64px;
  height: 64px;
  margin: 0 auto 14px;
  color: var(--gold);
}
.pricing-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}
.pricing-card .price {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 28px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  margin: 0 0 4px;
}
.pricing-card .price small {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-left: 4px;
}
.pricing-card .div-line {
  width: 100%;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--slate);
  margin: 18px 0 16px;
}
.pricing-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0;
  text-align: left;
}

/* ============ Fixtures cards ============ */
.fixtures-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.fixture-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--burgundy);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 24px 28px;
  transition: background .2s, box-shadow .2s;
}
.fixture-card:hover {
  background: var(--linen);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
}
.fixture-card.win { border-left-color: var(--forest); }
.fixture-card.loss { border-left-color: var(--burgundy); }
.fixture-card.draw { border-left-color: var(--gold); }
.badge-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  align-items: center;
}
.pill {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 5px 11px;
  border-radius: 14px;
}
.pill--squad { background: var(--navy); color: var(--ivory); }
.pill--type  { background: var(--gold); color: var(--navy); }
.pill--home  { background: var(--forest); color: var(--ivory); }
.pill--away  { background: var(--burgundy); color: var(--ivory); }
.pill--win   { background: var(--forest); color: var(--ivory); }
.pill--draw  { background: var(--gold); color: var(--navy); }
.pill--loss  { background: var(--burgundy); color: var(--ivory); }
.fixture-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 18px;
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  color: var(--navy);
}
.fixture-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0;
}
.result-line {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
}
.result-score {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--navy);
}
.result-date {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
}

/* ============ Bar chart (fixtures stats) ============ */
.chart-card {
  margin: 40px auto 0;
  max-width: 960px;
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
}
.chart-title {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 0 0 18px;
}
.chart-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.chart-label {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-weight: 600;
}
.chart-bar {
  display: flex;
  height: 24px;
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 2px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--linen);
}
.chart-bar > span {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ivory);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}
.chart-bar .seg-w { background: var(--burgundy); }
.chart-bar .seg-d { background: var(--gold); color: var(--navy); }
.chart-bar .seg-l { background: var(--ink); }
.chart-legend {
  display: flex;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 14px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.chart-legend span::before {
  content: "";
  display: inline-block;
  width: 12px;
  height: 8px;
  margin-right: 6px;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
.chart-legend .lg-w::before { background: var(--burgundy); }
.chart-legend .lg-d::before { background: var(--gold); }
.chart-legend .lg-l::before { background: var(--ink); }

/* ============ News article cards ============ */
.lead-article {
  max-width: 920px;
  margin: 0 auto 32px;
  background: var(--linen);
  border-left: 6px solid var(--burgundy);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 40px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  position: relative;
}
.lead-article .meta-row,
.article-card .meta-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.meta-row .cat { font-weight: 600; }
.meta-row .cat.ann { color: var(--forest); }
.meta-row .cat.ach { color: var(--forest); }
.meta-row .cat.fac { color: var(--gold); }
.meta-row .cat.rep { color: var(--navy); }
.meta-row .cat.evt { color: var(--burgundy); }
.meta-row .cat.news { color: var(--ink); }
.meta-row .dot {
  width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--slate);
  display: inline-block;
}
.meta-row .date { color: var(--ink); }
.lead-article h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 28px);
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.lead-article p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 17px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin: 0 0 18px;
}
.read-more {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--burgundy);
  font-weight: 600;
}

.articles-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.article-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  transition: background .2s, box-shadow .2s;
}
.article-card:hover {
  background: var(--linen);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lift);
}
.article-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 20px;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 10px;
}
.article-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0;
}

/* ============ Featured story (news) ============ */
.featured-story {
  background: var(--linen);
  position: relative;
  padding: 0 var(--pad-x);
}
.story-frieze {
  height: 44px;
  background-image: url("assets/frieze.svg");
  background-repeat: repeat-x;
  background-size: auto 100%;
  background-position: center;
}
.featured-story-inner {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 56px 0;
}
.featured-story h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 46px);
  margin: 16px 0 14px;
  color: var(--navy);
  line-height: 1.15;
}
.featured-story .body-essay {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--navy);
  text-align: left;
  margin: 24px 0 28px;
}

/* ============ Category browse (news) ============ */
.category-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  max-width: 980px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.category-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 32px 28px;
  position: relative;
  transition: background .25s, box-shadow .25s;
  cursor: pointer;
  border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);
}
.category-card:hover {
  background: var(--linen);
  border-top-color: var(--burgundy);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(27,42,74,0.15);
}
.category-card .cat-icon {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.category-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 8px;
}
.category-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}
.count-pill {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--linen);
  color: var(--gold);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 5px 12px;
  border-radius: 12px;
}
.category-card:hover .count-pill { background: var(--ivory); }

/* ============ Contact ============ */
.contact-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 0 auto;
  align-items: start;
}
.contact-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
.contact-item {
  background: var(--linen);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr;
  gap: 14px;
  transition: background .2s, border-left-color .2s;
}
.contact-item:hover {
  background: #e2dac6;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--burgundy);
  padding-left: 17px;
}
.contact-item .ci-icon { color: var(--gold); width: 22px; height: 22px; }
.contact-item .ci-label {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 0 0 4px;
}
.contact-item .ci-text {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0;
}
.estate-frame {
  background: var(--linen);
  padding: 18px;
  border: 2px solid var(--gold);
  position: relative;
}
.estate-frame::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 6px;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.estate-frame img,
.estate-frame svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  background: var(--ivory);
}
.estate-caption {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.enquiry-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  max-width: 1000px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.enquiry-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 32px;
  position: relative;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(27,42,74,0.07);
  transition: background .25s, border-color .25s;
}
.enquiry-card:hover {
  background: var(--linen);
  border: 2px solid var(--gold);
  padding: 31px;
}
.enquiry-card .badge {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.enquiry-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  transition: color .25s;
}
.enquiry-card:hover h3 { color: var(--burgundy); }
.enquiry-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}
.enquiry-card .email-link {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--burgundy);
  font-weight: 600;
}
.enquiry-card .email-link:hover {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold);
  text-decoration: none;
}

/* FAQ accordion */
.faq-list {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
}
.faq-icon-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 32px;
  margin: 0 0 32px;
  color: var(--gold);
}
.faq-icon-row svg { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
.faq-item {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  transition: background .2s, border-left-color .2s;
}
.faq-item summary {
  list-style: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 18px 24px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--navy);
  gap: 16px;
}
.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.faq-item .faq-toggle {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 24px;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-weight: 600;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}
.faq-item[open] {
  background: var(--linen);
  border-left-color: var(--burgundy);
}
.faq-item[open] .faq-toggle::before { content: "–"; }
.faq-item:not([open]) .faq-toggle::before { content: "+"; }
.faq-item .faq-body {
  padding: 0 24px 22px;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* ============ Footer ============ */
.site-footer {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--slate);
  padding: 56px var(--pad-x) 32px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(184,150,46,0.4);
  position: relative;
}
.site-footer::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; right: 0; top: 0;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--gold);
}
.footer-inner {
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 36px;
  align-items: start;
}
.footer-brand .brand-mark { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.footer-brand p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  font-style: italic;
}
.footer-col h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.footer-col ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
}
.footer-col li {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  color: var(--slate);
}
.footer-col a { color: var(--slate); }
.footer-col a:hover { color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none; }
.footer-bottom {
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 32px auto 0;
  padding-top: 24px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(214,217,224,0.15);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(214,217,224,0.6);
}

/* ============ Decorative pattern (CTA) ============ */
.diamond-pattern {
  background-image:
    repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(245,240,232,0.15) 0 1px, transparent 1px 24px),
    repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(245,240,232,0.15) 0 1px, transparent 1px 24px);
}

/* ============ Section closer rule ============ */
.section-closer {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 24px 0 0;
}
.section-closer .rule {
  height: 1px;
  width: 80px;
  background: var(--gold);
}
.section-closer .crest {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  color: var(--gold);
}

/* ============ Responsive ============ */
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .stats-grid,
  .coach-grid,
  .pricing-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
  .feature-grid,
  .feature-grid--six,
  .testimonial-grid,
  .category-grid,
  .articles-grid,
  .fixtures-grid,
  .enquiry-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
  .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
}

@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .nav-links {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 80%;
    max-width: 320px;
    background: var(--navy);
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 80px 28px 28px;
    transform: translateX(100%);
    transition: transform .3s ease;
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(184,150,46,0.3);
  }
  .nav-links.open { transform: translateX(0); }
  .nav-links a {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184,150,46,0.2);
  }
  .nav-toggle { display: inline-block; }

  .stats-grid,
  .feature-grid,
  .feature-grid--six,
  .testimonial-grid,
  .coach-grid,
  .pricing-grid,
  .category-grid,
  .articles-grid,
  .fixtures-grid,
  .enquiry-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .timeline::before { left: 16px; }
  .timeline-row {
    grid-template-columns: 16px 30px 1fr;
  }
  .timeline-row.left .timeline-card,
  .timeline-row.right .timeline-card {
    justify-self: stretch;
    margin: 0;
    grid-column: 3;
  }
  .timeline-row.left .filler,
  .timeline-row.right .filler { display: none; }
  .timeline-row.left .timeline-card { grid-row: 1; }

  .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .lead-article { padding: 28px 22px; }
  .faq-icon-row { display: none; }
  .cta-row { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
  .cta-row .btn { text-align: center; }
}

tool_use_result.content:
/* ==========================================================================
   Courtside & Crown — Heritage Tennis Academy
   Global Design System
   ========================================================================== */

@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400;1,600&family=Source+Serif+4:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

:root {
  --ivory: #F5F0E8;
  --navy: #1B2A4A;
  --burgundy: #7D1D3F;
  --gold: #B8962E;
  --gold-bright: #d4ae3a;
  --forest: #2D5016;
  --linen: #EAE3D2;
  --slate: #D6D9E0;
  --ink: #4A4E5A;
  --shadow-card: 0 2px 12px rgba(27, 42, 74, 0.08);
  --shadow-lift: 0 8px 24px rgba(27, 42, 74, 0.14);
  --max-w: 1200px;
  --pad-x: clamp(20px, 5vw, 80px);
  --section-pad: clamp(56px, 9vw, 96px);
  --font-heading: 'Playfair Display', 'Times New Roman', serif;
  --font-body: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;
  --font-accent: 'Montserrat', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--navy);
  background: var(--ivory);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}

img, svg { max-width: 100%; display: block; }

a { color: var(--burgundy); text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

p { margin: 0 0 1em; }

h1, h2, h3, h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 0.4em;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

/* ============ Navigation ============ */
.site-nav {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 60;
  background: var(--navy);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184, 150, 46, 0.3);
}
.nav-inner {
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 18px var(--pad-x);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 24px;
}
.brand-mark {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  color: var(--ivory);
  text-decoration: none;
}
.brand-mark:hover { text-decoration: none; }
.brand-mark svg { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
.brand-name {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  color: var(--ivory);
  line-height: 1;
}
.brand-name em {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.32em;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-style: normal;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin-top: 4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.nav-links {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  gap: 4px;
}
.nav-links a {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ivory);
  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
  transition: border-color .2s, color .2s;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold-bright); text-decoration: none; }
.nav-links a.is-active {
  color: var(--gold);
  border-bottom-color: var(--gold);
}
.nav-toggle {
  display: none;
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  color: var(--ivory);
  padding: 8px 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  cursor: pointer;
}

/* ============ Layout helpers ============ */
.section { padding: var(--section-pad) var(--pad-x); position: relative; }
.section-inner { max-width: var(--max-w); margin: 0 auto; }
.section--ivory { background: var(--ivory); }
.section--linen { background: var(--linen); }
.section--navy {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--ivory);
}
.section--navy h1, .section--navy h2, .section--navy h3 { color: var(--ivory); }

.section-head { text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 48px; }
.section-head--left { text-align: left; margin-left: 0; max-width: var(--max-w); }
.eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.eyebrow--burgundy { color: var(--burgundy); }
.section--navy .eyebrow { color: var(--gold); }

.headline {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}
.section--navy .headline { color: var(--ivory); }

.subheadline {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 19px);
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.65;
  font-style: italic;
  margin: 0 auto;
  max-width: 600px;
}
.section--navy .subheadline { color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.85); }

/* Ornamental divider — gold rule with diamond */
.ornament {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin: 18px auto 22px;
  gap: 10px;
  color: var(--gold);
}
.ornament--left { justify-content: flex-start; margin-left: 0; }
.ornament .rule {
  width: 56px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--gold);
  display: block;
}
.ornament .lozenge {
  width: 7px;
  height: 7px;
  background: var(--gold);
  transform: rotate(45deg);
}

/* ============ Buttons ============ */
.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 14px 36px;
  border: 2px solid transparent;
  cursor: pointer;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background .2s, color .2s, border-color .2s;
}
.btn:hover { text-decoration: none; }
.btn--primary {
  background: var(--burgundy);
  color: var(--ivory);
  border-color: var(--burgundy);
}
.btn--primary:hover {
  background: #67152f;
  border-color: var(--gold);
}
.btn--ghost-light {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ivory);
  border-color: var(--ivory);
}
.btn--ghost-light:hover {
  background: var(--ivory);
  color: var(--navy);
}
.btn--ghost-dark {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--navy);
  border-color: var(--navy);
}
.btn--ghost-dark:hover {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--ivory);
}
.btn--gold {
  background: var(--gold);
  color: var(--navy);
  border-color: var(--gold);
}
.btn--gold:hover {
  background: var(--gold-bright);
  border-color: var(--navy);
}
.cta-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-top: 24px;
}
.cta-row--left { justify-content: flex-start; }

/* ============ Hero ============ */
.hero {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--ivory);
  padding: clamp(60px, 8vw, 100px) var(--pad-x) clamp(80px, 10vw, 120px);
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hero::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 100%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.hero-inner {
  max-width: 860px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.hero-emblem {
  width: 150px;
  height: 150px;
  margin: 0 auto 24px;
}
.hero-eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.32em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin: 0;
}
.hero-headline {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 78px);
  line-height: 1.1;
  color: var(--ivory);
  margin: 24px 0 24px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.hero-sub {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 20px);
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--slate);
  max-width: 620px;
  margin: 0 auto 32px;
}
.hero-scroll {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 32px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  color: var(--gold);
  animation: bob 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  z-index: 1;
}
@keyframes bob {
  0%, 100% { transform: translate(-50%, 0); opacity: 0.7; }
  50% { transform: translate(-50%, 8px); opacity: 1; }
}

/* ============ Page Header (non-hero) ============ */
.page-header {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--ivory);
  padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 104px) var(--pad-x);
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.page-header-inner {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.page-header h1 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px);
  color: var(--ivory);
  margin: 8px 0 16px;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}
.page-header .subheadline {
  color: rgba(234, 227, 210, 0.9);
  max-width: 620px;
  margin: 0 auto 16px;
}
.page-header .body-copy {
  color: var(--slate);
  font-style: normal;
  font-size: 16px;
  max-width: 680px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.page-header .small-crest {
  margin: 0 auto 12px;
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  color: var(--gold);
}
.page-header__band {
  margin-top: 48px;
  width: 100%;
  height: 80px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 100%);
  position: relative;
}

/* ============ Stats ============ */
.stats-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 28px;
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.stat-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 32px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(27,42,74,0.07);
  position: relative;
}
.stat-card .stat-figure {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 56px);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  line-height: 1;
}
.stat-card .stat-rule {
  width: 40px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--gold);
  margin: 14px auto;
}
.stat-card .stat-desc {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.55;
  margin: 0;
}

/* ============ Feature grid (3-up) ============ */
.feature-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 28px;
  max-width: 1120px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.feature-card {
  background: var(--linen);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 40px 32px;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  transition: background .25s, border-color .25s, box-shadow .25s;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
}
.feature-card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; right: 0; top: 0;
  height: 3px;
  background: transparent;
  transition: background .25s;
}
.feature-card:hover {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border-color: var(--gold);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lift);
}
.feature-card:hover::before { background: var(--gold); }
.feature-card .icon-badge {
  width: 56px;
  height: 56px;
  background: var(--navy);
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--gold);
}
.feature-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}
.feature-card .micro-rule {
  width: 32px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--gold);
  margin: 0 auto 16px;
}
.feature-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0;
}

/* Six-up feature grid (facilities) */
.feature-grid--six {
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
}
.facility-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 28px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  transition: box-shadow .25s, border-top-color .25s;
  position: relative;
}
.facility-card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; right: 0; top: -1px;
  height: 3px;
  background: transparent;
  transition: background .25s;
}
.facility-card:hover {
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(27,42,74,0.10);
}
.facility-card:hover::before { background: var(--gold); }
.facility-card .facility-icon {
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  margin: 0 auto 10px;
  color: var(--navy);
}
.facility-card .micro-rule { width: 32px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold); margin: 0 auto 12px; }
.facility-card h3 { font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
.facility-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }

/* ============ Testimonial cards ============ */
.testimonial-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 28px;
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.testimonial-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 40px 32px 32px;
  position: relative;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
}
.testimonial-card .quote-mark {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 80px;
  line-height: 0.8;
  color: var(--gold);
  display: block;
  margin: -12px 0 -8px;
}
.testimonial-card blockquote {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 17px;
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--navy);
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin: 0 0 20px;
  padding: 0;
}
.testimonial-card .divider {
  width: 40px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--slate);
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.testimonial-card cite {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-style: normal;
}

/* ============ CTA section close ============ */
.cta-band {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--ivory);
  padding: clamp(56px, 9vw, 104px) var(--pad-x);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-align: center;
}
.cta-band__pattern {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  opacity: 0.08;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.cta-band__inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.cta-band h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(30px, 4.5vw, 52px);
  color: var(--ivory);
  margin: 12px 0 20px;
  line-height: 1.15;
}
.cta-band .subheadline {
  color: var(--slate);
  font-style: normal;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 19px);
}

/* ============ Timeline (Club page) ============ */
.timeline {
  position: relative;
  max-width: 980px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 16px 0;
}
.timeline::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 2px;
  background: var(--gold);
  transform: translateX(-50%);
}
.timeline-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 60px 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.timeline-row .node {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--navy);
  border: 2px solid var(--gold);
  margin: 0 auto;
  z-index: 1;
}
.timeline-row .connector {
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--gold);
}
.timeline-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 22px 22px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(27,42,74,0.08);
  max-width: 360px;
}
.timeline-card h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 18px;
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  color: var(--navy);
}
.timeline-card h4 .year { color: var(--gold); margin-right: 6px; }
.timeline-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0;
}
.timeline-row.left .timeline-card { justify-self: end; margin-right: 12px; }
.timeline-row.right .timeline-card { justify-self: start; margin-left: 12px; }
.timeline-row.left .filler { display: block; }
.timeline-row.right .filler { display: block; }

/* ============ Coach grid ============ */
.coach-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  max-width: 1140px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.coach-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 28px 22px;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  transition: background .25s, border-left-color .25s, box-shadow .25s;
}
.coach-card:hover {
  background: var(--linen);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--burgundy);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(27,42,74,0.10);
}
.coach-card .avatar {
  width: 72px;
  height: 72px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--linen);
  border: 2px solid var(--gold);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin: 0 auto 16px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 26px;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-weight: 600;
}
.coach-card .role {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0 0 4px;
}
.coach-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 18px;
  margin: 0 0 10px;
  color: var(--navy);
}
.coach-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  text-align: left;
}
.coach-card .credential {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--forest);
  color: var(--ivory);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 5px 10px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.coach-card .speciality {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold);
  display: block;
}

/* ============ Membership tiers (pricing) ============ */
.pricing-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  max-width: 1140px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.pricing-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 32px 26px;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  transition: box-shadow .25s, border-width .25s;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.pricing-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18); }
.pricing-card .ribbon {
  position: absolute;
  top: 12px;
  right: -38px;
  background: var(--burgundy);
  color: var(--ivory);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 5px 40px;
  transform: rotate(45deg);
}
.pricing-card .badge-icon {
  width: 64px;
  height: 64px;
  margin: 0 auto 14px;
  color: var(--gold);
}
.pricing-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}
.pricing-card .price {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 28px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  margin: 0 0 4px;
}
.pricing-card .price small {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-left: 4px;
}
.pricing-card .div-line {
  width: 100%;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--slate);
  margin: 18px 0 16px;
}
.pricing-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0;
  text-align: left;
}

/* ============ Fixtures cards ============ */
.fixtures-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.fixture-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--burgundy);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 24px 28px;
  transition: background .2s, box-shadow .2s;
}
.fixture-card:hover {
  background: var(--linen);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
}
.fixture-card.win { border-left-color: var(--forest); }
.fixture-card.loss { border-left-color: var(--burgundy); }
.fixture-card.draw { border-left-color: var(--gold); }
.badge-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  align-items: center;
}
.pill {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 5px 11px;
  border-radius: 14px;
}
.pill--squad { background: var(--navy); color: var(--ivory); }
.pill--type  { background: var(--gold); color: var(--navy); }
.pill--home  { background: var(--forest); color: var(--ivory); }
.pill--away  { background: var(--burgundy); color: var(--ivory); }
.pill--win   { background: var(--forest); color: var(--ivory); }
.pill--draw  { background: var(--gold); color: var(--navy); }
.pill--loss  { background: var(--burgundy); color: var(--ivory); }
.fixture-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 18px;
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  color: var(--navy);
}
.fixture-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0;
}
.result-line {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
}
.result-score {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--navy);
}
.result-date {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
}

/* ============ Bar chart (fixtures stats) ============ */
.chart-card {
  margin: 40px auto 0;
  max-width: 960px;
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
}
.chart-title {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 0 0 18px;
}
.chart-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.chart-label {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-weight: 600;
}
.chart-bar {
  display: flex;
  height: 24px;
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 2px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--linen);
}
.chart-bar > span {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ivory);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}
.chart-bar .seg-w { background: var(--burgundy); }
.chart-bar .seg-d { background: var(--gold); color: var(--navy); }
.chart-bar .seg-l { background: var(--ink); }
.chart-legend {
  display: flex;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 14px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.chart-legend span::before {
  content: "";
  display: inline-block;
  width: 12px;
  height: 8px;
  margin-right: 6px;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
.chart-legend .lg-w::before { background: var(--burgundy); }
.chart-legend .lg-d::before { background: var(--gold); }
.chart-legend .lg-l::before { background: var(--ink); }

/* ============ News article cards ============ */
.lead-article {
  max-width: 920px;
  margin: 0 auto 32px;
  background: var(--linen);
  border-left: 6px solid var(--burgundy);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 40px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  position: relative;
}
.lead-article .meta-row,
.article-card .meta-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.meta-row .cat { font-weight: 600; }
.meta-row .cat.ann { color: var(--forest); }
.meta-row .cat.ach { color: var(--forest); }
.meta-row .cat.fac { color: var(--gold); }
.meta-row .cat.rep { color: var(--navy); }
.meta-row .cat.evt { color: var(--burgundy); }
.meta-row .cat.news { color: var(--ink); }
.meta-row .dot {
  width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--slate);
  display: inline-block;
}
.meta-row .date { color: var(--ink); }
.lead-article h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 28px);
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.lead-article p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 17px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin: 0 0 18px;
}
.read-more {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--burgundy);
  font-weight: 600;
}

.articles-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.article-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  transition: background .2s, box-shadow .2s;
}
.article-card:hover {
  background: var(--linen);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lift);
}
.article-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 20px;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 10px;
}
.article-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0;
}

/* ============ Featured story (news) ============ */
.featured-story {
  background: var(--linen);
  position: relative;
  padding: 0 var(--pad-x);
}
.story-frieze {
  height: 44px;
  background-image: url("assets/frieze.svg");
  background-repeat: repeat-x;
  background-size: auto 100%;
  background-position: center;
}
.featured-story-inner {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 56px 0;
}
.featured-story h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 46px);
  margin: 16px 0 14px;
  color: var(--navy);
  line-height: 1.15;
}
.featured-story .body-essay {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--navy);
  text-align: left;
  margin: 24px 0 28px;
}

/* ============ Category browse (news) ============ */
.category-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  max-width: 980px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.category-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 32px 28px;
  position: relative;
  transition: background .25s, box-shadow .25s;
  cursor: pointer;
  border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);
}
.category-card:hover {
  background: var(--linen);
  border-top-color: var(--burgundy);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(27,42,74,0.15);
}
.category-card .cat-icon {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.category-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 8px;
}
.category-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}
.count-pill {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--linen);
  color: var(--gold);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 5px 12px;
  border-radius: 12px;
}
.category-card:hover .count-pill { background: var(--ivory); }

/* ============ Contact ============ */
.contact-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 0 auto;
  align-items: start;
}
.contact-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
.contact-item {
  background: var(--linen);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr;
  gap: 14px;
  transition: background .2s, border-left-color .2s;
}
.contact-item:hover {
  background: #e2dac6;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--burgundy);
  padding-left: 17px;
}
.contact-item .ci-icon { color: var(--gold); width: 22px; height: 22px; }
.contact-item .ci-label {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--navy);
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 0 0 4px;
}
.contact-item .ci-text {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0;
}
.estate-frame {
  background: var(--linen);
  padding: 18px;
  border: 2px solid var(--gold);
  position: relative;
}
.estate-frame::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 6px;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.estate-frame img,
.estate-frame svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  background: var(--ivory);
}
.estate-caption {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.enquiry-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  max-width: 1000px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.enquiry-card {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 32px;
  position: relative;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(27,42,74,0.07);
  transition: background .25s, border-color .25s;
}
.enquiry-card:hover {
  background: var(--linen);
  border: 2px solid var(--gold);
  padding: 31px;
}
.enquiry-card .badge {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.enquiry-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  transition: color .25s;
}
.enquiry-card:hover h3 { color: var(--burgundy); }
.enquiry-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}
.enquiry-card .email-link {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--burgundy);
  font-weight: 600;
}
.enquiry-card .email-link:hover {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold);
  text-decoration: none;
}

/* FAQ accordion */
.faq-list {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
}
.faq-icon-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 32px;
  margin: 0 0 32px;
  color: var(--gold);
}
.faq-icon-row svg { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
.faq-item {
  background: var(--ivory);
  border: 1px solid var(--slate);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--slate);
  border-radius: 4px;
  transition: background .2s, border-left-color .2s;
}
.faq-item summary {
  list-style: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 18px 24px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--navy);
  gap: 16px;
}
.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.faq-item .faq-toggle {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 24px;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-weight: 600;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}
.faq-item[open] {
  background: var(--linen);
  border-left-color: var(--burgundy);
}
.faq-item[open] .faq-toggle::before { content: "–"; }
.faq-item:not([open]) .faq-toggle::before { content: "+"; }
.faq-item .faq-body {
  padding: 0 24px 22px;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* ============ Footer ============ */
.site-footer {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--slate);
  padding: 56px var(--pad-x) 32px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(184,150,46,0.4);
  position: relative;
}
.site-footer::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; right: 0; top: 0;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--gold);
}
.footer-inner {
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 36px;
  align-items: start;
}
.footer-brand .brand-mark { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.footer-brand p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  font-style: italic;
}
.footer-col h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.footer-col ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
}
.footer-col li {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  color: var(--slate);
}
.footer-col a { color: var(--slate); }
.footer-col a:hover { color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none; }
.footer-bottom {
  max-width: var(--max-w);
  margin: 32px auto 0;
  padding-top: 24px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(214,217,224,0.15);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(214,217,224,0.6);
}

/* ============ Decorative pattern (CTA) ============ */
.diamond-pattern {
  background-image:
    repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(245,240,232,0.15) 0 1px, transparent 1px 24px),
    repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(245,240,232,0.15) 0 1px, transparent 1px 24px);
}

/* ============ Section closer rule ============ */
.section-closer {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 24px 0 0;
}
.section-closer .rule {
  height: 1px;
  width: 80px;
  background: var(--gold);
}
.section-closer .crest {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  color: var(--gold);
}

/* ============ Responsive ============ */
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .stats-grid,
  .coach-grid,
  .pricing-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
  .feature-grid,
  .feature-grid--six,
  .testimonial-grid,
  .category-grid,
  .articles-grid,
  .fixtures-grid,
  .enquiry-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
  .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
}

@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .nav-links {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 80%;
    max-width: 320px;
    background: var(--navy);
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 80px 28px 28px;
    transform: translateX(100%);
    transition: transform .3s ease;
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(184,150,46,0.3);
  }
  .nav-links.open { transform: translateX(0); }
  .nav-links a {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184,150,46,0.2);
  }
  .nav-toggle { display: inline-block; }

  .stats-grid,
  .feature-grid,
  .feature-grid--six,
  .testimonial-grid,
  .coach-grid,
  .pricing-grid,
  .category-grid,
  .articles-grid,
  .fixtures-grid,
  .enquiry-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .timeline::before { left: 16px; }
  .timeline-row {
    grid-template-columns: 16px 30px 1fr;
  }
  .timeline-row.left .timeline-card,
  .timeline-row.right .timeline-card {
    justify-self: stretch;
    margin: 0;
    grid-column: 3;
  }
  .timeline-row.left .filler,
  .timeline-row.right .filler { display: none; }
  .timeline-row.left .timeline-card { grid-row: 1; }

  .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .lead-article { padding: 28px 22px; }
  .faq-icon-row { display: none; }
  .cta-row { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
  .cta-row .btn { text-align: center; }
}

input.content:
/* Mobile nav toggle */
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
  var toggle = document.querySelector('.nav-toggle');
  var links = document.querySelector('.nav-links');
  if (toggle && links) {
    toggle.addEventListener('click', function () {
      links.classList.toggle('open');
      var open = links.classList.contains('open');
      toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
      toggle.textContent = open ? 'Close' : 'Menu';
    });
    document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      if (!links.contains(e.target) && !toggle.contains(e.target) && links.classList.contains('open')) {
        links.classList.remove('open');
        toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
        toggle.textContent = 'Menu';
      }
    });
  }
});

